  "materials_text": "MATERIALS\n Costar\u00ae 6-Well Flat-Bottom Plate, Tissue Culture-Treated 50 Plates\r STEMCELL Technologies Inc. Catalog #38015 \n TrypLE\u2122 Express Enzyme Thermo Fisher Scientific Catalog #12604013 \n Fisherbrand\u2122 Cell Scrapers Fisher Scientific Catalog #11587692 \n Falcon\u2122 15mL Conical Centrifuge Tubes Fisher Scientific Catalog #14-959-53A \n DPBS no calcium no magnesium Thermo Fisher Scientific Catalog #14190144 \n Cultrex\u00ae Reduced Growth Factor Basement Membrane Matrix Type 2 (BME 2) Trevigen Catalog #3533-010-02 \n Falcon 50mL Conical Centrifuge Tubes Fisher Scientific Catalog #14-432-22 \n Eppendorf Tubes 5.0 ml Eppendorf Catalog #0030122321 \n **Equipment**\n\n1. Sterile cell culture hood\n1. Centrifuge\n1. 1000 \u00b5l and 200 \u00b5l pipettes and tips\n1. Pipetteboy\n1. Stripettes\n1. 37oC waterbath\n1. 37oC humidified incubator (5% CO2)\n1. Light microscope\n\n",
