    "previous_guid": "5F2B6C20849B11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Incubate at 37 \u00b0C  \n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "6",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 922871,
    "guid": "CB4E6010849B11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "previous_id": 922869,
    "previous_guid": "86B72BD0849B11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Check organoid suspension under microscope after 5 minutes and then as required to assess the dissociation of organoids. Use a P1000 to pipette the cell suspension up and down to help dissociate organoids. Stop incubation when organoids broken down to small clumps of cells.\n\n**Avoid breaking organoids down to single cells**\n \n\n\n[Tube on microscope.jpg]](https://content.protocols.io/public/417fb9cd53044f7c6eb3e93de0e730f2c4aafce8332e96e3c04a19c0dd149ad8/b7ccbc2j7.jpg)\nCheck if organoid suspension has broken down to small clumps of cells on a microscope. \n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "7",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 922874,
    "guid": "986E9510849C11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "previous_id": 922871,
    "previous_guid": "CB4E6010849B11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Centrifuge at{\"centrifuge\":\"800\",\"duration\":0,\"guid\":\"B1C6F1D0854E11EAAE7161651166D294\",\"id\":0,\"label\":\"\",\"pause\":null,\"preset\":[],\"start\":null,\"temperature\":\"\",\"temperatureUnit\":10,\"unit\":34} for 2 minutes.\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "8",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 922875,
    "guid": "A2EE6B00849C11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "previous_id": 922874,
    "previous_guid": "986E9510849C11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Aspirate supernatant to leave organoid cell pellet.\n\n**If the organoid suspension does not pellet during centrifugation or there is a grey haze above the pellet (residual BME2), aspirate as much supernatant as possible. Re-suspend in ice cold PBS and repeat centrifugation.**\n \n\n\n[BME haze.png]](https://content.protocols.io/public/417fb9cd53044f7c6eb3e93de0e730f2c4aafce8332e96e3c04a19c0dd149ad8/cdx2bc2j7.png)\nBME2 layer above prganoid pellet after centrifugation \n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "9",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 922880,
    "guid": "62B87890849D11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "previous_id": 922875,
    "previous_guid": "A2EE6B00849C11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Re-suspend pellet in appropriate amount of 80% BME2 ( 200 \u00b5L per well of a 6 well plate). \n\n\n\n**Start by re-suspending pellet in a small volume to break down, then add additional BME2 to required volume.**\n \n\n\n**BME2 must be dispensed as quickly as possible as it will begin to set at room temperature. A cool block could be used to help keep the temperature down while plating.**\n \n\n\n\n**Avoid creating bubbles while re-suspending pellet.**\n \n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "10",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 922881,
    "guid": "9843E620849D11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "previous_id": 922880,
    "previous_guid": "62B87890849D11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Using a P200 pipette dispense a total of 200 \u00b5L organoid/BME2 suspension per well of a 6 well plate as 10 \u00b5L - 15 \u00b5L droplets.\n\n\n\n[3 Blobbing.mp4]](https://content.protocols.io/public/39d00e41493ec066d7dd0e7c078b5b75f229b95406aa219f66df2f3cfadb4f29/cdwxbc6qx.mp4) \n\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "11",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 922882,
    "guid": "BC181C10849D11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "previous_id": 922881,
    "previous_guid": "9843E620849D11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Place in a 37 \u00b0C incubator (5% CO2) for 15-30 minutes to allow BME2 to set.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "12",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 922884,
    "guid": "E5FFCD20849D11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "previous_id": 922882,
    "previous_guid": "BC181C10849D11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Add 2 mL of appropriate organoid media per well of a 6 well plate.\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "13",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 922890,
    "guid": "28ED4900849E11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "previous_id": 922884,
    "previous_guid": "E5FFCD20849D11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Return to incubator. Media change twice a week until ready to passage.\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "14",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 923874,
    "guid": "BC7D6920854311EAAE7161651166D294",
    "previous_id": 922803,
    "previous_guid": "97BB77E0847F11EAB53C112B1A2624CA",
    "section": "<p>Protocol</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Aspirate media from wells and add 1 mL or 2 mL TrypLE to each well.\n\n**If any of the following are true collect organoids and media in a tube and centrifuge to pellet before adding TrypLE**\n- **BME2 droplets detached from plate and floating in media**\n- **Lots of cells or organoids floating in the media**\n- **Lots of fibroblasts attached to the plate**\n \n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 36027,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "2",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   }
